{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05566","headline":"奉和贺监林月清酌 · 王湾","name":"奉和贺监林月清酌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华月当秋满，朝英假兴同。\n净林新霁入，规院小凉通。\n碎影行筵里，摇花落酒中。\n清宵凝爽意，倂此助文雄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}